cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Zero-TVM: Phi-3-mini in the browser on hand-written WGSL kernels"
abstract: >-
  A browser-native Phi-3-mini inference engine built on 10 hand-written WGSL
  kernel roles (27 files) and ~2,000 lines of TypeScript, replacing WebLLM /
  MLC-LLM's TVM-compiled 85-kernel stack while reaching ~80% of its decode
  speed on identical quantized weights.
type: software
authors:
